# The small, deterministic Bitext-derived eval set (data/*.jsonl) and the gold sets
# (src/qaudit/eval/labels/) ARE committed, so a clone can run the harness and label
# without a dataset download. They are used under Bitext's CDLA-Sharing-1.0 licence
# (see README). Regenerate with `make data && make synth`.

